//! Cities: first economy experiment. Amounts use quarter units; routes use half-hex costs.
//!
//! This module holds the city types, the tuning constants and the city scenarios' setup; each
//! submodule adds an `impl GameState` block for one concern: `builds` (the build queues,
//! building sites, completing builds), `citizens` (the manager and its workers, growth, the
//! economy tick), `logistics` (delivery routes and income), `rail` (Railhead transfers),
//! `founding` (settlers) and `view` (the city and Barracks views, ending planning).

